+
+Status: **candidate source mount, not accepted ION state**.
+
+This folder mounts the deterministic Living Operational Graph v0.4 schema-repair package into the active current-context path used by the local JOC cockpit projection.
+
+Mounted source package:
+
+```text
+diffs/ION_UI_DOMAIN_CONTEXT_PACKAGE_v0_4_SCHEMA_REPAIR.zip
+```
+
+Mounted paths:
+
+```text
+SAMPLE/living_operational_graph_sample_v0_3.json
+LAYOUT/living_graph_layout_fixture_v0_3.json
+SCHEMAS/living_graph_bundle.schema.v0_3.json
